<title>SPAIN: Spain details 1997 tax revenue objectives.</title>
<headline>Spain details 1997 tax revenue objectives.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Economics Ministry gave the following targets for tax revenues as included in the 1997 budget law. In trillions of pesetas:</p>
<p>		gross revenues	returns	net revenues</p>
<p> Income tax	6.49		  0.919	     5.57</p>
<p> Corp tax	  1.79		  0.365	     1.42</p>
<p> import VAT	4.10		  1.18		2.92</p>
<p> Domestic VAT    0.954				     0.954</p>
<p> Special taxes   2.16					2.16</p>
<p> External traffic0.109				     0.109</p>
<p> Other	     0.285				     0.285</p>
<p> TOTAL	    15.89		  2.46	     13.42</p>
<p>NOTE: Returns column does not include returns to non-residents for withholding on public debt interest payments. -- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
